    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/c0b295373626ec564b96fc2c1533c03e.webp?t=1753826437\" width=800 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/808eb85c0e3f400dccae8d0b324f7525.poster.avif?t=1753826437\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/808eb85c0e3f400dccae8d0b324f7525.webm?t=1753826437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/808eb85c0e3f400dccae8d0b324f7525.mp4?t=1753826437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty Six is an action packed\u00a0bullet hell that you play through the multiverse- <strong>and experience how it was made in parallel dimensions</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/8424eecf70832a13a880ea8787b3e813.webp?t=1753826437\" width=800 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/e7e42f2ddf53d96638aaf947d010152b.poster.avif?t=1753826437\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/e7e42f2ddf53d96638aaf947d010152b.webm?t=1753826437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/e7e42f2ddf53d96638aaf947d010152b.mp4?t=1753826437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dimension changes how the <strong>player</strong> and how the <strong>blocks</strong> work. However, these can be mixed, resulting in 676 different verses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: Start from <strong>AA</strong> and get to <strong>ZZ</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/ea3279d719de5fe25db4322682420d4a.avif?t=1753826437\" data-has-big width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/2f3da88d11d1e7aa1ae8dc7e0c14ad64.webp?t=1753826437\" width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the game is being actively developed, here's a list of the planned features!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Collectibles for each verse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A special attack that changes as you play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Bosses that appear in certain verses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/c0b295373626ec564b96fc2c1533c03e.webp?t=1753826437\" width=800 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/808eb85c0e3f400dccae8d0b324f7525.poster.avif?t=1753826437\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/808eb85c0e3f400dccae8d0b324f7525.webm?t=1753826437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/808eb85c0e3f400dccae8d0b324f7525.mp4?t=1753826437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twenty Six is an action packed\u00a0bullet hell that you play through the multiverse- <strong>and experience how it was made in parallel dimensions</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/8424eecf70832a13a880ea8787b3e813.webp?t=1753826437\" width=800 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/e7e42f2ddf53d96638aaf947d010152b.poster.avif?t=1753826437\" width=600 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/e7e42f2ddf53d96638aaf947d010152b.webm?t=1753826437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/e7e42f2ddf53d96638aaf947d010152b.mp4?t=1753826437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each dimension changes how the <strong>player</strong> and how the <strong>blocks</strong> work. However, these can be mixed, resulting in 676 different verses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: Start from <strong>AA</strong> and get to <strong>ZZ</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/ea3279d719de5fe25db4322682420d4a.avif?t=1753826437\" data-has-big width=800 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638060/extras/2f3da88d11d1e7aa1ae8dc7e0c14ad64.webp?t=1753826437\" width=800 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the game is being actively developed, here's a list of the planned features!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Collectibles for each verse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A special attack that changes as you play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Bosses that appear in certain verses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
